</div>
<div class="cbx-panel"><h4>Where the rent goes, per year</h4>##stack##<p style="margin:.7rem 0 0">##stack_note##</p></div><div class="cbx-panel"><h4>Net yield against typical bands</h4><div class="cbx-gaugewrap"><div class="cbx-gauge"><i style="width:30%;background:#ef4444"></i><i style="width:20%;background:#f59e0b"></i><i style="width:20%;background:#22c55e"></i><i style="width:30%;background:#15803d"></i></div><div class="cbx-pin" style="left:##pct##%"></div></div><div class="cbx-ticks"><span style="left:0%">0%</span><span style="left:30%">3%</span><span style="left:50%">5%</span><span style="left:70%">7%</span><span style="left:100%">10%</span></div><p style="margin:.6rem 0 0">Gross yield is yearly rent over price. Net yield also subtracts vacancy, running costs and property tax, before the mortgage.</p></div>
<p class="cbx-note">Deposit only: purchase taxes, legal fees and renovation costs are not included in the cash invested. Figures are estimates, not financial advice.</p>
</div>]]></exitlayout>
